{"id":"8330fa9041fa77ae","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-randomized-space-machine.md","title":"具有两个转移表的随机空间机器","display":"df-randomized-space-machine — 具有两个转移表的随机空间机器","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-randomized-space-machine","aliases":["28-df-randomized-space-machine"],"display":"df-randomized-space-machine — 具有两个转移表的随机空间机器","depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-configuration]]","[[28-df-configuration-transition]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, §7.1 Definition 7.1; §7.7 Definition 7.18; explicit local total-machine representation","source_printed_pages":"125,139","source_pdf_pages":"151,165","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"revision":"R5"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-randomized-space-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-randomized-space-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-randomized-space-machine — 具有两个转移表的随机空间机器"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"599727eea07e91d7\" href=\"?note=599727eea07e91d7\" title=\"28-df-configuration\">28-df-configuration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6b648ff230619ba2\" href=\"?note=6b648ff230619ba2\" title=\"28-df-configuration-transition\">28-df-configuration-transition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, §7.1 Definition 7.1; §7.7 Definition 7.18; explicit local total-machine representation"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"125,139"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"151,165"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_x\">\\(I_x\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"599727eea07e91d7\" href=\"?note=599727eea07e91d7\" title=\"28-df-configuration\">28-df-configuration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6b648ff230619ba2\" href=\"?note=6b648ff230619ba2\" title=\"28-df-configuration-transition\">28-df-configuration-transition</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_b=(Q_b,\\Sigma,\\Gamma_b,\\delta_b,q_{0,b},q_{\\mathrm{acc},b},q_{\\mathrm{rej},b})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M_b=(Q_b,\\Sigma,\\Gamma_b,\\delta_b,q_{0,b},q_{\\mathrm{acc},b},q_{\\mathrm{rej},b})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。候选随机机 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(M_0,M_1)\">\\(M=(M_0,M_1)\\)</span>；结构相同时以共同的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,\\Gamma,k,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\">\\(Q,\\Gamma,k,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\)</span> 表示分量。除机器集本身外，后续各构造的机器参数均限于这些结构分量相同的配对；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{M,b,x}\">\\(F_{M,b,x}\\)</span> 的配置参数属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}(M_0,x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}(M_0,x)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(x\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(r\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；有限随机串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的坐标域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,\\ldots,|r|-1\\}\">\\(\\{0,\\ldots,|r|-1\\}\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_i\">\\(r_i\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le i&lt;|r|\">\\(0\\le i&lt;|r|\\)</span> 时取值。配置投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(c)\">\\(q(c)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_j(c)\">\\(i_j(c)\\)</span> 分别是状态和第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 个带头位置。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\mathbb N}=\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\(\\overline{\\mathbb N}=\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span>；上确界按该序及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,1]\">\\([0,1]\\)</span> 取值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RTM}\\coloneqq\\{(M_0,M_1)\\in\\mathrm{TM}^2:(Q_0,\\Gamma_0,k_{M_0},q_{0,0},q_{\\mathrm{acc},0},q_{\\mathrm{rej},0})=(Q_1,\\Gamma_1,k_{M_1},q_{0,1},q_{\\mathrm{acc},1},q_{\\mathrm{rej},1})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RTM}\\coloneqq\\{(M_0,M_1)\\in\\mathrm{TM}^2:(Q_0,\\Gamma_0,k_{M_0},q_{0,0},q_{\\mathrm{acc},0},q_{\\mathrm{rej},0})=(Q_1,\\Gamma_1,k_{M_1},q_{0,1},q_{\\mathrm{acc},1},q_{\\mathrm{rej},1})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_{M,b,x}(c)\\coloneqq\\iota d\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M_0,x)\\;[(q(c)\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\land d=c)\\lor\\operatorname{Step}_{M_b}(c,d)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_{M,b,x}(c)\\coloneqq\\iota d\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M_0,x)\\;[(q(c)\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\land d=c)\\lor\\operatorname{Step}_{M_b}(c,d)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T^0_0\\coloneqq I_x,\\qquad T^0_j(a)\\coloneqq\\sqcup\\quad(j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\},\\ a\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad C_0(M,x,r)\\coloneqq\\langle q_0,(T^0_j)_{j=0}^k,(0)_{j=0}^k\\rangle,\\qquad C_{i+1}(M,x,r)\\coloneqq F_{M,r_i,x}(C_i(M,x,r))\\quad(0\\le i&lt;|r|).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T^0_0\\coloneqq I_x,\\qquad T^0_j(a)\\coloneqq\\sqcup\\quad(j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\},\\ a\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad C_0(M,x,r)\\coloneqq\\langle q_0,(T^0_j)_{j=0}^k,(0)_{j=0}^k\\rangle,\\qquad C_{i+1}(M,x,r)\\coloneqq F_{M,r_i,x}(C_i(M,x,r))\\quad(0\\le i&lt;|r|).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Halt}_{M}(x)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall r\\in\\Sigma^t\\ q(C_t(M,x,r))\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Halt}_{M}(x)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall r\\in\\Sigma^t\\ q(C_t(M,x,r))\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a_{M,t}(x)\\coloneqq 2^{-t}|\\{r\\in\\Sigma^t:q(C_t(M,x,r))=q_{\\mathrm{acc}}\\}|,\\qquad \\operatorname{Acc}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\sup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}a_{M,t}(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a_{M,t}(x)\\coloneqq 2^{-t}|\\{r\\in\\Sigma^t:q(C_t(M,x,r))=q_{\\mathrm{acc}}\\}|,\\qquad \\operatorname{Acc}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\sup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}a_{M,t}(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RSpace}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\sup_{r\\in\\Sigma^*}\\sum_{j=1}^k\\left(1+\\max_{0\\le i\\le|r|}i_j(C_i(M,x,r))\\right)\\in\\overline{\\mathbb N}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RSpace}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\sup_{r\\in\\Sigma^*}\\sum_{j=1}^k\\left(1+\\max_{0\\le i\\le|r|}i_j(C_i(M,x,r))\\right)\\in\\overline{\\mathbb N}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 Definition 7.1 的双转移函数表示，使用本目录只读输入和曾访问工作格的空间约定；公平硬币每步独立选择转移表。随机选择不存成可双向回读的输入带，避免把随机带头当成免费空间。</p>\n<p>每个非停机配置在选定转移表下有唯一后继，停机配置吸收，因此递归对有限随机串良定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_{M,t}\">\\(a_{M,t}\\)</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 单调，概率上确界存在；Halt 明示所有分支在某个共同有限时刻内停机。没有预设所有RTM都满足它。空间只计工作头曾到达的最大位置，吸收延长不改变空间。此接口供随机小空间类复用；检索本书全部268个基线原子后，既有有限随机带PTM接口不能独立表达流式随机位的空间计费，故补建。</p>\n<p>来源：§7.1 Definition 7.1，印刷125 / PDF151；§7.7 Definition 7.18，印刷139 / PDF165。读过对应定义；只读输入、吸收延长和总停机约定是显式本地表示。</p>\n<p>R7：在本节点的 Hypothesis 内明确有限随机串采用零起始下标，使逐步转移 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_i\">\\(r_i\\)</span> 的坐标域与递归边界一致；机器与资源签名保持原义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"599727eea07e91d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-configuration]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration-transition","status":"resolved","id":"6b648ff230619ba2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-configuration-transition]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathrm{TM}$、$\\operatorname{Conf}$、$I_x$、$\\operatorname{Step}$ 分别见 [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"599727eea07e91d7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathrm{TM}$、$\\operatorname{Conf}$、$I_x$、$\\operatorname{Step}$ 分别见 [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration-transition","status":"resolved","id":"6b648ff230619ba2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathrm{TM}$、$\\operatorname{Conf}$、$I_x$、$\\operatorname{Step}$ 分别见 [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conf}","display":false},{"tex":"I_x","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Step}","display":false},{"tex":"M_b=(Q_b,\\Sigma,\\Gamma_b,\\delta_b,q_{0,b},q_{\\mathrm{acc},b},q_{\\mathrm{rej},b})\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"M=(M_0,M_1)","display":false},{"tex":"Q,\\Gamma,k,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}","display":false},{"tex":"F_{M,b,x}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conf}(M_0,x)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,\\ldots,|r|-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"r_i","display":false},{"tex":"0\\le i<|r|","display":false},{"tex":"q(c)","display":false},{"tex":"i_j(c)","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{\\mathbb N}=\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RTM}\\coloneqq\\{(M_0,M_1)\\in\\mathrm{TM}^2:(Q_0,\\Gamma_0,k_{M_0},q_{0,0},q_{\\mathrm{acc},0},q_{\\mathrm{rej},0})=(Q_1,\\Gamma_1,k_{M_1},q_{0,1},q_{\\mathrm{acc},1},q_{\\mathrm{rej},1})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"F_{M,b,x}(c)\\coloneqq\\iota d\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M_0,x)\\;[(q(c)\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\land d=c)\\lor\\operatorname{Step}_{M_b}(c,d)].","display":true},{"tex":"T^0_0\\coloneqq I_x,\\qquad T^0_j(a)\\coloneqq\\sqcup\\quad(j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\},\\ a\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad C_0(M,x,r)\\coloneqq\\langle q_0,(T^0_j)_{j=0}^k,(0)_{j=0}^k\\rangle,\\qquad C_{i+1}(M,x,r)\\coloneqq F_{M,r_i,x}(C_i(M,x,r))\\quad(0\\le i<|r|).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Halt}_{M}(x)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall r\\in\\Sigma^t\\ q(C_t(M,x,r))\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"a_{M,t}(x)\\coloneqq 2^{-t}|\\{r\\in\\Sigma^t:q(C_t(M,x,r))=q_{\\mathrm{acc}}\\}|,\\qquad \\operatorname{Acc}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\sup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}a_{M,t}(x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RSpace}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\sup_{r\\in\\Sigma^*}\\sum_{j=1}^k\\left(1+\\max_{0\\le i\\le|r|}i_j(C_i(M,x,r))\\right)\\in\\overline{\\mathbb N}.","display":true},{"tex":"a_{M,t}","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"r_i","display":false}],"bytes":3848,"backlinks":[{"id":"2288f41c38b2dcba","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathsf{RTM}$、$\\operatorname{Halt}_M$、$\\operatorname{Acc}_M$、$\\operatorname{RSpace}_M$ 见 [[28-df-randomized-space-machine]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-305","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-bptime]]、[[28-df-randomized-reduction]]、[[28-prop-randomized-reduction-bpp-closure]]、[[28-lem-von-neumann-unbiasing]]、[[28-lem-computable-biased-coin]]、[[28-df-randomized-space-machine]]、[[28-df-bpl-rl]]。"}],"outgoing":["1965e2b0765554c9","599727eea07e91d7","6b648ff230619ba2"]}